    "updated_at": "2024-12-06T01:37:08Z",
    "body": "I would indeed prefer to match ES's formatting and use \"TIMER\". I guess we should do all the enums at once though.\r\n\r\nIt'd be even better if we could link to the definitions of the enum values in the ES spec, but I don't know if they have proper `<dfn>`s.",
