    "created_at": "2024-12-06T16:38:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-06T16:42:02Z",
    "body": "I forget why we decided to use a text transform instead of just making it actually uppercase to begin with. I'm fine with changing the source if there's not a compelling reason not to.\r\n\r\nRe: copying, we're [considering](https://github.com/tc39/ecmarkup/issues/550) having ecmarkup add some hidden text with tildes so these values would copy as `~timer~`, though that's mostly for the convenience of people copying algorithm steps into comments in tests or implementations.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
